{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103460","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910346001:1":{"text":"타라사의 일족들이여, 나의 동포들이여. 지금 대체 무엇들을 하고 있는 게냐?","source_cn":"塔拉萨的族裔们，我的同胞们。你们究竟在做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DFCE24CA3018008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910346002:1":{"text":"이 두 아이가 우리의 가족이 되기로 선택하든 그렇지 않든, 어미 산호의 복구를 도와준 은인이라는 사실은 변함이 없단다. 그러니 아이들의 의사를 반드시 존중해야 하지.","source_cn":"无论这两个孩子是否选择成为我们的家人，他们都是帮助修复...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BFBE0C9E317752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910346003:1":{"text":"하지만 회유기는...","source_cn":"可是洄游季——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD4C07BB3BA6911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910346004:1":{"text":"진정하거라. 격렬하게 요동치는 해류 때문에 이성을 잃었구나.","source_cn":"冷静下来，孩子。你被激荡的洋流冲昏了头脑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE520784FA1331259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910346005:1":{"text":"회유기를 위해 준비한 양분이 부족한 건 분명 걱정스러운 일이지만 그건 이 두 아이의 잘못이 아니란다. 누군가를 강요할 이유는 더더욱 될 수 없지.","source_cn":"为洄游季准备的养料不足，的确令人忧心。但这不是这两个孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C6D11BDC8A2AF97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910346006:1":{"text":"내가 반드시 해결 방법을 찾겠다고 약속하마.","source_cn":"我保证，我们会去找解决方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DC740C353D6CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910346007:1":{"text":"그러니 지금은 놀란 아이들이 편히 쉴 수 있도록 길을 비켜주려무나. ","source_cn":"也希望你们能保证——现在，让开路，让这两个受惊的孩子好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24BDC2328C1FCDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910346008:1":{"text":"엘피라, 아이들을 집으로 데려가렴.","source_cn":"艾菲拉，带他们回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0D270D93F7C62CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910346009:1":{"text":"...으, 응.","source_cn":"……好、好的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA5C299589A6597","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910346010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 톨란. 얼른 따라와!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4030898F484B0CB6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 톨란. 얼른 따라와!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 톨란. 얼른 따라와!"